<p>Dear <%= @owner.try(:username) || @owner.try(:email) %>,</p>

<p>Your virtual machine for order <strong>#<%= @order.order_number %></strong> is now ready.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Access Credentials</h3>
  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="font-size: 14px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">IP Address:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @vm.ip_address %></td>
    </tr>
    <% if @vm.rdp_port.present? %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">RDP Port:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @vm.rdp_port %></td>
    </tr>
    <% end %>
    <% if @vm.ssh_port.present? %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">SSH Port:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @vm.ssh_port %></td>
    </tr>
    <% end %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Username:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @vm.ssh_username %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; color: #6b7280;">Password:</td>
      <td style="padding: 5px 0; font-weight: bold; text-align: right;"><%= @vm.ssh_password || @vm.ssh_password_encrypted %></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p><strong>Connection Guide:</strong></p>
<% if @vm.rdp_port.present? %>
<p>Use any RDP client (like Remote Desktop Connection on Windows) to connect to: <code><%= @vm.ip_address %>:<%= @vm.rdp_port %></code></p>
<% else %>
<p>Open your terminal and run: <code>ssh <%= @vm.ssh_username %>@<%= @vm.ip_address %> -p <%= @vm.ssh_port || 22 %></code></p>
<% end %>

<div style="background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #ffeeba; font-size: 13px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <strong>Security Note:</strong> Please change your password after your first login.
</div>

<p>You can also manage your instance in your dashboard: <a href="<%= ENV['FRONTEND_URL'] %>/dashboard/orders" style="color: #3b82f6; text-decoration: none;">View Orders</a></p>

<p>Best Regards,<br>The ProxySock Team</p>
